[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027842381","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108193#issuecomment-3027842381","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108193","id":3027842381,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60eTVN","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T13:13:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T13:13:09Z","body":"I've got a similar problem with a custom made Java plug for Google Play Integrity API..\n\nThe plug works Perfectly in 4.5dev3, but stops working in 4.5beta 1\n\nSo I assumed the plug didn't get correctly included on the final app build.\n\nI haven't investigated it yet, \nas I was waiting for final Godot 4.5 version to be released..\n\nAnd address all problems there, with hopefully a version that builds for SDK 35 with NDK28 solving both:\nThe 16Kb memory problem (NDK28)\nThe SDK35 requirement from 31 Aug 2025\n\nBut apparently some Java Plugs seems to break with beta 1.\n\nSome other don't break:\nOfficial Admob Plug works OK (at least for showing Banners, and the GDPR consent process..)\nCustom Audio Capture Plug also works perfectly.\n\nSo in my case is only the Google Play Integrity plugin that fails.\n\n-Maybe you could try to build the app with Godot 4.5 dev3, dev4 or dev5, \nand see if the problem persists??\n\nI'd say it's possible it still works with dev3,\nbut somewhere around dev5 and beta1 the thing fuskered a little.. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027842381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028273212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108193#issuecomment-3028273212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108193","id":3028273212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60f8g8","user":{"login":"kilojool","id":2656574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTY1NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2656574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool","html_url":"https://github.com/kilojool","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T15:19:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T15:19:03Z","body":"> -Maybe you could try to build the app with Godot 4.5 dev3, dev4 or dev5, and see if the problem persists??\n\nYou're right, I could get it working in dev5, but not beta1.\n\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028273212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028669399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108193#issuecomment-3028669399","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108193","id":3028669399,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60hdPX","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T17:28:52Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T17:28:52Z","body":"I just tested the [Google Play Billing](https://github.com/godot-sdk-integrations/godot-google-play-billing) plugin. It works as expected in Godot 4.4, but the singleton is not found in **4.5 beta1**.\n\nFor this plugin, the issue is caused by `getActivity()` returning `null` in constructor. This is due to [godotengine/godot#102866](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102866), which removes reliance on `Activity` and instead Android Service to host godot.\n\nTo fix this in the billing plugin, you should replace calls to `getActivity()` with `getContext()`. If an `Activity` is absolutely required, you must first check for `null`.\n\nFor example, in the billing plugin, replace: getActivity() with getContext().\n\nhttps://github.com/godot-sdk-integrations/godot-google-play-billing/blob/3a61cbbc28c80d79449ca70464b8171bc7834a52/godot-google-play-billing/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/googleplaybilling/GodotGooglePlayBilling.java#L80","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028669399/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028752624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108193#issuecomment-3028752624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108193","id":3028752624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60hxjw","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T17:41:51Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T17:41:51Z","body":"@kilojool @ernzo Could you please check your plugin and replace getActivity() calls with getContext(), if possible?\nIf an Activity is required, make sure to perform null checks, and for any early calls, ensure they are made inside the `onMainCreate` method.\n\nLet me know if this resolves the issue. If not, please share the Logcat errors so I can investigate further.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3028752624/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3030905947","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108193#issuecomment-3030905947","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108193","id":3030905947,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60p_Rb","user":{"login":"kilojool","id":2656574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2NTY1NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2656574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool","html_url":"https://github.com/kilojool","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kilojool/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T05:48:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T05:48:43Z","body":"@syntaxerror247 Thanks, that worked! I only needed to replace the getActivity() call in the constructor, while the later calls seem to be working for me!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3030905947/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]